Island
Mox Sapphire
Brainstorm
Ponder
Island x3
Counterspell
Mana Leak
Lightning Bolt
Swords to Plowshares
Island x8

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Demonic Tutor
Swamp x4
Swamp x3
Black Lotus
Swamp x5

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
